cus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-zinc-300"><option selected="">feature/timeout</option><option>review/retry-policy</option></select></label><label class="min-w-0"><span class="mb-2 block text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">Environment</span><select class="min-h-11 w-full min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-white/15 bg-[#191b1d] px-2 text-xs text-zinc-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-zinc-300"><option selected="">Development</option><option>Test</option><option>Production · held</option></select></label></div><div class="p-4 sm:p-5"><div class="relative min-h-[320px] min-w-0 sm:min-h-[340px]"><div style="opacity:1"><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-zinc-400"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-200">A</span> Axiom Agent <span class="ml-auto rounded border border-white/10 px-2 py-1">Engineer</span></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#141617] p-4 sm:p-5 ml-5 border-white/10 bg-white/[0.025]"><p class="text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-100"><span class="sr-only">Make the request timeout configurable. Keep the retry ceiling unchanged, then prepare a review.</span><span aria-hidden="true">Make the request timeout configurable. Keep the retry ceiling unchanged, then prepare a review.<span class="invisible">▍</span></span></p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#141617] p-4 sm:p-5"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-orange-200">Attached sample context</p><dl class="mt-4 grid gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><dt class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400">Repository</dt><dd class="mt-1 break-words text-xs leading-5 text-zinc-200">acme/customer-web</dd></div><div class="min-w-0"><dt class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400">Branch</dt><dd class="mt-1 break-words text-xs leading-5 text-zinc-200">feature/timeout</dd></div><div class="min-w-0"><dt class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400">Environment</dt><dd class="mt-1 break-words text-xs leading-5 text-zinc-200">Development</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] px-4 py-3"><p class="text-[11px] leading-5 text-zinc-400">Illustrated from Axiom workflows. Sample content; no live actions.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-5 rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.02] p-4"><p class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-300">Current availability</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400">Implementation preview: repository editing and approved project checks. Native behavior is unverified; a general terminal and autonomous local Agent execution are not available.</p><a class="mt-2 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300 underline-offset-4 hover:underline" href="/docs/approval-workflow">Read approval workflow <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-3 w-3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg></a></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-5 text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><p>Scripted sample data. No cloud account, repository, AI credits, or deployment is touched.</p><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center gap-2 font-medium text-zinc-300" href="/demo">Explore every safe demo <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-4 w-4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg></a></div></section></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:py-20"><div class="max-w-xl"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-zinc-400">The release, made legible</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-medium tracking-[-0.045em] text-zinc-100 sm:text-4xl">From repository context to a recorded outcome.</h2><p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">This is a conceptual sequence. Support depends on the installed version and enabled workflow; these steps do not establish complete coverage for every action.</p></div><div class="mt-10 min-w-0"><p id="_R_2eav5tlb_-help" class="text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400">Conceptual illustration · local explanation only. Choose a stage to inspect the record it describes.</p><div class="mt-5 grid min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.12] bg-white/[0.02] lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr]"><ol aria-label="Conceptual workflow" aria-describedby="_R_2eav5tlb_-help" class="m-0 list-none p-3 sm:p-5"><li class="relative min-w-0"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute bottom-0 left-[26px] top-12 w-px bg-white/[0.12]"></span><h3 class="m-0"><button id="_R_2eav5tlb_-stage-1" type="button" aria-pressed="true" aria-controls="_R_2eav5tlb_-record" class="relative my-1 flex min-h-[60px] w-full items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border px-3 py-3 text-left focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sky-300 border-white/20 bg-white/[0.07] text-zinc-100"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border bg-[#141414] font-mono text-[10px] border-sky-300/60 text-sky-200">01</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm font-medium leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em]">Repository context</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 shrink-0 text-xs">→</span></button></h3></li><li class="relative min-w-0"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute bottom-0 left-[26px] top-12 w-px bg-white/[0.12]"></span><h3 class="m-0"><button id="_R_2eav5tlb_-stage-2" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="_R_2eav5tlb_-record" class="relative my-1 flex min-h-[60px] w-full items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border px-3 py-3 text-left focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sky-300 border-transparent text-zinc-400 hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:text-zinc-200"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border bg-[#141414] font-mono text-[10px] border-white/15 text-zinc-500">02</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm font-medium leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em]">Exact proposal</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 shrink-0 text-xs"></span></button></h3></li><li class="relative min-w-0"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute bottom-0 left-[26px] top-12 w-px bg-white/[0.12]"></span><h3 class="m-0"><button id="_R_2eav5tlb_-stage-3" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="_R_2eav5tlb_-record" class="relative my-1 flex min-h-[60px] w-full items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border px-3 py-3 text-left focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sky-300 border-transparent text-zinc-400 hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:text-zinc-200"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border bg-[#141414] font-mono text-[10px] border-white/15 text-zinc-500">03</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm font-medium leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em]">Independent review</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 shrink-0 text-xs"></span></button></h3></li><li class="relative min-w-0"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute bottom-0 left-[26px] top-12 w-px bg-white/[0.12]"></span><h3 class="m-0"><button id="_R_2eav5tlb_-stage-4" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="_R_2eav5tlb_-record" class="relative my-1 flex min-h-[60px] w-full items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border px-3 py-3 text-left focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sky-300 border-transparent text-zinc-400 hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:text-zinc-200"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border bg-[#141414] font-mono text-[10px] border-white/15 text-zinc-500">04</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm font-medium leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em]">Separate requester execution</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 shrink-0 text-xs"></span></button></h3></li><li class="relative min-w-0"><h3 class="m-0"><button id="_R_2eav5tlb_-stage-5" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="_R_2eav5tlb_-record" class="relative my-1 flex min-h-[60px] w-full items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border px-3 py-3 text-left focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sky-300 border-transparent text-zinc-400 hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:text-zinc-200"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border bg-[#141414] font-mono text-[10px] border-white/15 text-zinc-500">05</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm font-medium leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em]">Recorded outcome and recovery</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 shrink-0 text-xs"></span></button></h3></li></ol><div id="_R_2eav5tlb_-record" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_2eav5tlb_-stage-1" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col border-t border-white/[0.1] bg-black/15 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-zinc-500"><span>Record / <!-- -->01</span><span class="h-px flex-1 bg-white/10"></span><span>Concept</span></div><p class="mt-8 text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-0.035em] text-zinc-100">Scope record</p><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] leading-6 text-sky-200/80">Repository / branch / environment</p><p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">Start with the repository, branch, environment, and requested outcome so the work has a clear scope.</p><p class="mt-6 border-t border-dashed border-white/15 pt-5 text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400">Context gives a proposal its boundaries. It does not grant permission to act.</p></div></div><div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-1 text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400"><p>Check your installed version and enabled workflow for available controls.</p><p>Governance Intelligence remains incomplete; this illustration does not establish activation or action coverage.</p></div></div></section><section class="border-y border-white/[0.07] bg-[#141414] px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px]"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-zinc-400">AI · Governance · Integrations</p><h2 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-medium tracking-[-0.045em] text-zinc-100 sm:text-4xl">Context for the agent. Control for your team.</h2><div class="mt-10 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.025] p-6 sm:p-7"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium tracking-[-0.02em] text-zinc-100">AI</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Use selected repository context to ask questions and inspect proposed actions. Available tools and permissions depend on the installed version and enabled workflow.</p></article><article class="rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.025] p-6 sm:p-7"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium tracking-[-0.02em] text-zinc-100">Governance</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Keep the exact proposal, independent review, separate requester execution, and recorded outcome in view where supported. Full Governance Intelligence coverage and activation are not complete.</p></article><article class="rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.025] p-6 sm:p-7"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium tracking-[-0.02em] text-zinc-100">Integrations</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">GitHub, Airflow, and AWS workflows keep repository scope, dependency evidence, and approval context explicit. Available operations depend on the connected account and validated provider permissions; a preview is not proof of a completed deployment.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden border-y border-white/[0.07] px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-20"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1280px] gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:items-center"><div><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-zinc-400">Intentional boundaries</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-medium tracking-[-0.045em] text-zinc-100 sm:text-4xl">The right surface for each job.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-base leading-7 text-zinc-300">The browser handles identity, lightweight account context, and approved provider consent. The installed Agent performs validation and keeps deployment operations deliberate.</p></div><div class="grid gap-3"><div class="rounded-xl border border-white/[0.12] bg-white/[0.025] p-5"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">GitHub</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Repository-scoped, read-only release evidence is the first source of truth.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-white/[0.12] bg-white/[0.025] p-5"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">Axiom Agent</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">The installed workspace validates provider access and holds consequential deployment operations.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-white/[0.12] bg-white/[0.025] p-5"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">Web companion</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">A lighter signed-in space where approved provider consent, profile, help, and connection context begin.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:py-20"><div class="rounded-xl border border-white/[0.1] bg-white/[0.025] p-7 sm:p-10"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-zinc-400">Choose your next step</p><div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between"><div><h2 class="text-3xl font-medium tracking-[-0.045em] text-zinc-100 sm:text-4xl">Prove the workflow before you depend on it.</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Local previews are not evidence of a shipped release. Check available downloads and their release information for what is offered; confirm version-specific support before depending on an operation.</p></div><a class="shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 px-5 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 transition hover:bg-white" href="/docs/getting-started">Get started</a></div><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-300"><a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/docs/approval-workflow">Read the approval guide</a><a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/integrations">Explore integrations</a><a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/demo">Explore the scripted demo</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer border-t border-white/[0.07] bg-[#090a08] px-5 pb-8 sm:px-8 lg:px-10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px]"><section class="flex flex-col gap-8 border-b border-white/[0.07] py-12 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between lg:py-16" aria-labelledby="footer-cta-heading"><div><p class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-zinc-400">Axiom Agent</p><h2 id="footer-cta-heading" class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-[-0.045em] text-zinc-100 sm:text-5xl">Engineering intent, under control.</h2></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 hover:bg-white" href="/product">Explore Axiom</a><a class="rounded-lg border border-orange-300/30 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-orange-200 transition hover:border-orange-300/60 hover:bg-orange-300/[0.06]" href="/support">Founding Supporters</a></div></section><div class="grid gap-12 py-16 sm:grid-cols-2 lg: