><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/contact">Contact</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/status">Service status</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="text-xs text-zinc-400">Legal</h3><ul class="mt-5 space-y-3"><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/terms">Terms</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/security">Security</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-7 text-xs text-zinc-400 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Vision XIX Labs. All rights reserved.</p><p>Production access is service-verified. Demonstrations are clearly labeled.</p></div></div></footer></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div><button aria-label="Open Axiom Assistant" class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-[9998] hidden min-h-11 items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#171717]/90 px-3.5 py-2 text-zinc-200 shadow-[0_14px_40px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)] backdrop-blur-xl transition-all hover:border-white/[0.16] hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] hover:text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-coral/50 md:flex"><div class="relative flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.035]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-zinc-300"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20.25 8.511c.884.284 1.5 1.128 1.5 2.097v4.286c0 1.136-.847 2.1-1.98 2.193-.34.027-.68.052-1.02.072v3.091l-3-3c-1.354 0-2.694-.055-4.02-.163a2.115 2.115 0 0 1-.825-.242m9.345-8.334a2.126 2.126 0 0 0-.476-.095 48.64 48.64 0 0 0-8.048 0c-1.131.094-1.976 1.057-1.976 2